<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34309" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπερι-πᾰτέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>walk about in</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβάταις</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσοις τοῖς ἁγίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					4.3.10
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς διανοίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.643
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				274
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἐν ὑμῖν</span>
			<i>tarry among</i> you, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				26.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				6.16
			</span></i>: abs., <i>walk about</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμα τῷ συμποσίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Symp.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. διαύλους τινάς</span>
			<i>walk</i> several times to and fro, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				1.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>walk about upon</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὑπ᾽
			οὐρανόν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>, al.; <i>trample on,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PHolm.
				18.30
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>insult</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.57a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
